+	// throttled by sys_MaxFPS or between levels, so a wall-clock timeout would drop the look for a
+	// viewport that is simply not being redrawn. One frame of grace, plus one, because the frame
+	// counter advances on every RenderBegin and a second (secondary) viewport can bump it between
+	// this hook and the level editor viewport's next call.
